Z||000000||fiero56||04-06-2001||10:08 PM||||4 of my auto mags arrived in the box this week, and all 4 had photos of the latest viper. Could this be such hot news, that every auto mag printed has to put the viper on the cover and detail the car quite extensively inside. Sure, they got more power out of the engine, and it still looks sweet as ever...Methinks Chrysler is pulling a few strings trying to get a better image out to the public so they can get back on their feet. Or is this Viper thing bigger news than I think?||||reg||5
